<rml>
<head>
	<!-- The mob info board under the target board (NOVA-40; legacy
	     uitargetinfo.py InfoBoard, OLD uiTarget.py:249-756). While the
	     target-info flag is on, the target board makes
	     nui_target_info.InfoBoard (controller assets/root/nui_target_info.py),
	     a subclass of the legacy class on proxies: the stats (from the
	     client's mob_proto), the race and resist lines, the drops the server
	     listed and their merged +0..+9 rows are legacy's code. The stats as
	     text lines with separators, the drops as rows (icon, text, the
	     attacker and guaranteed lines the drop rule will fill). The whole row
	     hovers (the slot hover rule) and shows the item's tooltip. The list
	     scrolls in RmlUi; the retry after a request the server dropped is a
	     nui-countdown, so nothing runs per frame. -->
	<title>target-info</title>
	<link type="text/template" href="../../nui.rtpl"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="target-info.rcss"/>
</head>
<body template="nui" class="nui-overlay nui-below-legacy-ui target-info" data-model="target_info">
	<div class="target-info__wrap">
		<div id="target-info-board" class="target-info__board nui-board nui-board--tooltip nui-fx nui-interactive">
			<div class="target-info__stats">
				<div class="target-info__line" data-for="l : lines" data-class-target-info__sep="l.sep">{{ l.text }}</div>
			</div>
			<div id="target-info-rows" class="target-info__drops nui-list__viewport" data-if="size(rows) > 0">
				<div class="target-info__row nui-anim" data-for="r, i : rows" data-attr-id="'target-info-row-' + i"
				     data-event-mouseover="row_over(i)" data-event-mouseout="row_out()">
					<div class="target-info__icon"><img class="target-info__img" data-if="r.icon != ''" data-attr-src="r.icon"/></div>
					<div class="target-info__text">
						<span class="target-info__name">{{ r.text }}</span>
						<span class="target-info__extra" data-for="e : r.lines">{{ e }}</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<nui-countdown class="target-info__clock" format="none" data-if="retry > 0" data-attr-end="retry" data-event-countdownend="retry_done()"/>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
